plaintext
* SPICE Netlist for the Circuit
.model PMOS PMOS
.model NMOS NMOS

VDD 2 0 DC 5V

* PMOS Transistor ML
M1 6 7 2 2 PMOS

* NMOS Transistor MDA
M2 6 3 8 3 NMOS

* NMOS Transistor MDB
M3 8 5 0 3 NMOS 

* Nodes
* 2 -> VDD
* 6 -> Vo
* 7 -> MDA & MDB gates node
* 8 -> MDA source, MDB drain
* 0 -> Ground

.END